{"code":0,"data":{"title":"vivo小游戏支付接入流程","content":"<p>备注：详细了解vivo小游戏支付接入流程&amp;技术问题，<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://minigame.vivo.com.cn/documents/#/lesson/open-ability/pay\">请点击</a>。</p><p><br></p><h3 id=\"s-cnv8q0tv\">【接入流程】</h3><p>1、进入<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/manageCenter\">管理中心</a>，点击小游戏，进入页面后点击创建小游戏。</p><h2 id=\"s-fpxq5fki\"><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/01d85l/20220930162003948926.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"285\" data-natural-width=\"1052\" data-natural-height=\"375\" data-type=\"image\"></h2><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/le92w6/20220930164503721195.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"160\" data-natural-width=\"1868\" data-natural-height=\"213\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>2、填写小游戏名称、包名，上传图标后点击立即创建。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/0tr3cq/20220930162418623493.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"1400\" height=\"533\" data-natural-width=\"1889\" data-natural-height=\"719\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>3、在小游戏详情页中点击支付服务，在此页面中查看cpid，appid，appsecret，并参照接入文档接入。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250508/11u3k3/20250508162156631292.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"172\" data-natural-width=\"1129\" data-natural-height=\"216\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/ueditor/20220930/mcg8ow/20220930164053347913.png\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" width=\"901\" height=\"500\" data-natural-width=\"1036\" data-natural-height=\"575\" data-type=\"image\"></p><p><br></p><p>4、接入完成后在小游戏详情页中点击完善信息，提交rpk包并完善相关信息，审核通过后即可上线。</p><p><img src=\"https://swsdl.vivo.com.cn/appstore/developer/uploadFile/20250508/pckrf3/20250508161931461196.png\" data-natural-width=\"1901\" data-natural-height=\"489\" data-type=\"image\"></p>","versionCode":10,"updateTime":1712042258000,"breadCrumbs":"小游戏管理,技术文档,小游戏支付接入流程","docType":3,"docMessageType":"app_distribution"}}